'''Present''' is a [[common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2017 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2017|2017 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
The whole knife is wrapped in a green and white wrapping paper that uses a square pattern. Its blade has a red ribbon neatly tied on it, completing the present, hence the name.

